  "title": "Plan for the questions customers ask in ChatGPT | Fyntix",
  "description": "Use real buying questions to plan an AI discovery review and identify where your website can explain the business more usefully.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
